  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Hình chiếu của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> lên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Do đó góc giữa <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></semantics></math> (vì tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông ở <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math>).<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>, do đó\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>tan</mo><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mover><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tVậy góc giữa <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/773d3d93f76ef4fd9139fe02e2055295829e503f95bc0d72f2a680f336dbd85b.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
